// The session recorder (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, section 8; project owner,
// 2026-10-23, review a23vvez8): how much of what a person does xWorks keeps
// in memory, to write out as a session when asked or when it fails.
(
    // At least this many minutes are kept; older steps go.
    minutes: 5,
    // How often, at most, the window's state is noted, when it's at rest,
    // as where a session can start: what's kept is up to this much longer.
    checkpoint_seconds: 30,
)
